 type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/a03e83b1180c550caadb980ae42a53ea.avif?t=1749055935\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive craft, repair and surgery</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/e3fcdfb87f82fb4ea6898a7aea5cd500.poster.avif?t=1749055935\" width=560 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/e3fcdfb87f82fb4ea6898a7aea5cd500.webm?t=1749055935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/e3fcdfb87f82fb4ea6898a7aea5cd500.mp4?t=1749055935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Abandoned camps and safe rooms are places to rest and work with supplies. When entering a camp, first of all, light a fire - to gain access to various activities:<br><br><strong><i>Cooking</i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/3288bacb282967468a5083dcbc880555.poster.avif?t=1749055935\" width=560 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/3288bacb282967468a5083dcbc880555.webm?t=1749055935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/3288bacb282967468a5083dcbc880555.mp4?t=1749055935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>----------------------------------------------<br><strong><i>Repair</i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/253989c54ea65b141ee9aeb7cf422d2e.poster.avif?t=1749055935\" width=560 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/253989c54ea65b141ee9aeb7cf422d2e.webm?t=1749055935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/253989c54ea65b141ee9aeb7cf422d2e.mp4?t=1749055935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>----------------------------------------------<br><strong><i>Surgery</i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/183f1e8f95d70ea6bac5529c11c8da3a.poster.avif?t=1749055935\" width=560 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/183f1e8f95d70ea6bac5529c11c8da3a.webm?t=1749055935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/183f1e8f95d70ea6bac5529c11c8da3a.mp4?t=1749055935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>----------------------------------------------<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/a03e83b1180c550caadb980ae42a53ea.avif?t=1749055935\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world open for exploration</strong><br>Complex locations with many hidden paths and secrets. To get to the next level, it is not necessary to kill the boss or look for the key to the door \u2013 you can find a secret passage and get through it, although this path is also far from easy.<br>The increasing difficulty of passing is expressed not only in the opponents, but also in the collected items, which differ from biome to biome: in the forest you can find many useful (and not very useful) plants, in city warehouses \u2013 food and medicines, and in the depths of the besieged castle supplies have long run out \u2013 only darkness and despair remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/d957be21d79857890772838d80a30ae6.poster.avif?t=1749055935\" width=560 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/d957be21d79857890772838d80a30ae6.webm?t=1749055935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/d957be21d79857890772838d80a30ae6.mp4?t=1749055935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/a03e83b1180c550caadb980ae42a53ea.avif?t=1749055935\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn graphics</strong><br>All elements of the game, from the characters and locations to the interface, are hand\u2013drawn - creating an atmosphere and emphasizing the aesthetics of the game world.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640750/extras/aecc77c49a41092634ce77fe76ca7a6b.avif?t=1749055935\" width=620 height=64 /></span></p></li></ul>",
